<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 11 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: ':only-child' is true only for a node whose parent has exactly one element child")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
var root = mk_node("#root", -1)
var a = mk_node("div", 0)
var b = mk_node("div", 0)
var c = mk_node("div", 1)
